<h3 id="main-menu">Main Menu</h3>
<p>Create a menu in <b>Appearance &gt; Menus</b> and assign it to the <b>Main Menu</b> location.</p>
<p>To display featured-image thumbnails in a dropdown, enable <b>CSS Classes</b> in Screen Options and add <code>pt-special-dropdown</code> to the top-level menu item. Set a featured image on each page linked from its submenu.</p>
